  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rab 401.04 Appraisal Management Company Renewal. Appraisal management company registrations shall expire on the last day of the month 2 years from the date of issuance. A renewal notification shall be sent to all registered appraisal management companies at least 60 days prior to expiration.\n\nSource. #10270, eff 2-2-13, EXPIRED: 2-2-23\n\nNew. #13968, eff 5-18-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rab100-500.html"
